      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ある品を預かって貰いたい。“組織”から抜ける際に\n持ち出した強力な武器だ。追っ手が迫っている……\n奴らが手を出し難い、君に預けられれば安心だ。\n急ぎ、私の元へ来てくれ。待っているぞ。",
        "official_en": "I'd like you to hold on to something—a weapon I took\nwhen I left a certain organization. There are pursuers\nclosing in on me, and with your daunting reputation,\nyou seem like a good person to leave it with.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
