        "branch_phase": null,
        "authored_group": "MSQID_Comp_ThreeHouses_Led"
      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "来てくれて感謝する。私はしばらく身を隠す。\n無事に生き延びることができたら、また姿を現そう。\nそれまで預けた武器は自由に使ってくれて構わない。\n恐らく、君の助けになるだろう。",
        "official_en": "Thank you for speaking with me. I have to go into\nhiding, but if I survive, we will meet again.\nMeanwhile, I trust that the weapon I gave you will\nprove useful in your forthcoming battles.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
